<title>UK: Dresdner Bank sets 500 mln mark bond.</title>
<headline>Dresdner Bank sets 500 mln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DRESDNER BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    26.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.35    PAY DATE    26.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    100.20    SPREAD	+41 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.35	SELL CONC  2.15	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
